From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:57:39 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] phy: samsung-ufs: Allow a delay between calibration table
 entries

The PHY tables can only describe register writes. Tensor G4's Hibern8
exit sequence in Google's zuma calibration tables waits 10 us
(COMMON_WAIT) between its write to the PMA common register 0x000 and
its writes to the lane registers.

Add a table entry for such a wait. Like a common block write, it runs
once, on the lane 0 pass. Existing tables are unchanged.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/soc/gs/+/204078758737776959ecc85c527a00fd2cabb62f/drivers/ufs/zuma/ufs-cal.h
Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/soc/gs/+/204078758737776959ecc85c527a00fd2cabb62f/drivers/ufs/zuma/ufs-cal-if.c
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c | 6 ++++++
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c
index 1aea9c2d6..baa0dc60a 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c
@@ -34,6 +34,12 @@ void samsung_ufs_phy_config(struct samsung_ufs_phy *phy,
 {
 	enum {LANE_0, LANE_1}; /* lane index */
 
+	if (cfg->id == PHY_DELAY_BLK) {
+		if (lane == LANE_0)
+			udelay(cfg->val);
+		return;
+	}
+
 	switch (lane) {
 	case LANE_0:
 		writel(cfg->val, (phy)->reg_pma + cfg->off_0);
diff --git a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h
index e1a41df26..1270f5e30 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h
+++ b/drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
 
 #define PHY_COMN_BLK	1
 #define PHY_TRSV_BLK	2
+#define PHY_DELAY_BLK	3
 #define END_UFS_PHY_CFG { 0 }
 #define PHY_TRSV_CH_OFFSET	0x30
 #define PHY_APB_ADDR(off)	((off) << 2)
@@ -38,6 +39,12 @@
 #define PHY_TRSV_REG_CFG(o, v, d)	\
 	PHY_TRSV_REG_CFG_OFFSET(o, v, d, PHY_TRSV_CH_OFFSET)
 
+/* Wait @us microseconds before the next entry of a table, once for all lanes. */
+#define PHY_DELAY_US_CFG(us) {	\
+	.val = (us),		\
+	.id = PHY_DELAY_BLK,	\
+}
+
 /* UFS PHY registers */
 #define PHY_PLL_LOCK_STATUS	0x1e
 
